    "body": "I think it makes more sense to define the \"environment discarding steps\". Cf https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-adopt-ext, https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#unloading-document-cleanup-steps.\r\n\r\nAlso nits on the `<dfn>` syntax: `data-x=\"\"` is not needed if the text inside the element is already good. And, you should add `data-export=\"\"` so that it automatically becomes usable in Bikeshed-based specs (like service worker).",
    "created_at": "2018-05-30T16:46:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-06-05T06:57:50Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/3723#discussion_r191841180",
