    "diff_hunk": "@@ -97224,9 +97229,9 @@ interface <dfn>SharedWorkerGlobalScope</dfn> : <span>WorkerGlobalScope</span> {\n \n     <p>If the algorithm asynchronously completes with null, <span>queue a task</span> to <span\n     data-x=\"concept-event-fire\">fire an event</span> named <code data-x=\"event-error\">error</code>\n-    at <var>worker</var>, and return. Otherwise, continue the rest of these steps after\n-    the algorithm's asynchronous completion, with <var>script</var> being the asynchronous\n-    completion value.</p>\n+    at <var>worker</var>, <span data-x=\"discard an environment\">discard</span> <var>inside\n+    settings</var>, and return. Otherwise, continue the rest of these steps after the algorithm's\n+    asynchronous completion, with <var>script</var> being the asynchronous completion value.</p>",
